// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P53393259" "PBAoE, Moderate DMG (Energy), Minor DoT (Negative Energy), -RES(Foe, All), Chance for Terrorize(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1671738149" "You unleash a dreadful howl that strikes fear into those arrayed against you. Affected targets suffer energy damage, then negative energy damage over time as the howl's influence takes effect. Targets also suffer reduced resistance to all damage types. There is a small chance that a target will be rendered afraid by the howl, but any target so affected cannot be made afraid again for a long while."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4053283180" "DoT (Negative Energy), -RES(All), Chance for Terrorize"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2162061616" "You are suffering negative energy damage over time and your resistance to all damage types has been reduced. There is also a chance that you are terrorized."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
