// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1747267291" "You suffer {Damage} points of negative energy damage from {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2114513192" "You cower in fear due to {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName}."

